### key-security
Set lifetimes, require confirmation, and inspect agent state.

**Commands:**
- `ssh-add -t 1h ~/.ssh/id_ed25519`
- `ssh-add -c ~/.ssh/id_ed25519`
- `ssh-add -t 3600`
- `ssh-add -x && ssh-add -X`
- `ssh -A user@jumphost`
